WEBVTT

00:00:07.458 --> 00:00:10.167
"Rikdo FQX"

00:00:11.125 --> 00:00:12.625
"Written Oath"

00:00:12.625 --> 00:00:13.958
"Oath.

00:00:13.958 --> 00:00:16.000
I, Koshi Rikdo, hereby pledge,

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:17.833
in the event that
Excel Saga is animated,

00:00:17.833 --> 00:00:20.333
that I have given the staff full
authority over its contents,

00:00:20.333 --> 00:00:23.625
and that regardless of how the
finished product turns out,

00:00:23.625 --> 00:00:26.250
I will not take such
actions as complaining,

00:00:26.250 --> 00:00:29.125
protesting, condemning,
or filing charges."

00:00:29.125 --> 00:00:30.917
"Koshi Rikdo"

00:00:41.667 --> 00:00:45.583
<i>That isn't love</i>

00:00:45.583 --> 00:00:49.375
<i>Love isn't that</i>

00:00:49.375 --> 00:00:57.333
<i>I am in love, but I am not loved</i>

00:00:57.333 --> 00:01:01.167
<i>Definitely isn't love</i>

00:01:01.167 --> 00:01:05.167
<i>Derriere isn't love</i>

00:01:05.167 --> 00:01:12.917
<i>I want to be loved,</i>
<i>but I never seek it out</i>

00:01:13.875 --> 00:01:17.750
<i>I offer myself and throw my life away</i>

00:01:17.750 --> 00:01:21.792
<i>Looking neither left nor right,</i>
<i>I will just earnestly</i>

00:01:21.792 --> 00:01:25.708
<i>Cheat, wheedle, interfere</i>

00:01:25.708 --> 00:01:28.917
<i>And trample down and</i>
<i>kick strangers</i>

00:01:28.917 --> 00:01:31.208
<i>And we get the hell out!</i>
<i>(And we get the hell out!)</i>

00:01:31.208 --> 00:01:33.083
<i>And we get the hell out!</i>
<i>(And we get the hell out!)</i>

00:01:33.083 --> 00:01:34.833
<i>And we get the hell out!</i>
<i>(And we get the hell out!)</i>

00:01:34.833 --> 00:01:36.917
<i>And we get the hell out!</i>

00:01:36.917 --> 00:01:41.583
<i>Even if I slip on a banana peel</i>

00:01:41.583 --> 00:01:44.833
<i>It is all for his sake anyway</i>

00:01:44.833 --> 00:01:49.333
<i>If anything, that is probably</i>

00:01:49.333 --> 00:01:57.208
<i>A kind of loyalty called love</i>

00:02:04.125 --> 00:02:08.333
"30th Graduation Ceremony"
"Public Inunabe High School"

00:02:10.917 --> 00:02:12.583
"We're graduating!" "Bye-bye!"

00:02:12.583 --> 00:02:15.750
"We're graduating!" "Bye-bye!"
"Farewell!"

00:02:16.500 --> 00:02:19.958
Excel, did you find a job yet?

00:02:19.958 --> 00:02:23.333
ACROSS!

00:02:27.792 --> 00:02:30.458
ACROSS!

00:02:30.458 --> 00:02:32.458
ACROSS!

00:02:34.125 --> 00:02:38.625
ACROSS!

00:02:38.625 --> 00:02:40.833
ACROSS!

00:02:49.292 --> 00:02:50.458
It's an accident. An accident.

00:02:50.458 --> 00:02:52.208
She is so dead.

00:02:52.208 --> 00:02:56.000
She's bleeding. She's bleeding.

00:02:56.000 --> 00:02:57.625
"ACR"
All right, grab the other leg for me!

00:02:57.625 --> 00:02:59.125
"ACR"
Ready!

00:03:02.958 --> 00:03:05.500
Hey, you! Hang in there,
in your own way!

00:03:05.500 --> 00:03:09.167
She's still got just a tad bit
of a pulse of sorts.

00:03:09.167 --> 00:03:12.292
ACROSS...

00:03:12.292 --> 00:03:13.458
You can do it!

00:03:13.458 --> 00:03:17.042
I have no basis for this, but it
might just be too early to die.

00:03:17.042 --> 00:03:20.042
Oh, my, her life's flashing by.

00:03:20.042 --> 00:03:22.042
That's no good.

00:03:26.708 --> 00:03:28.708
Hail, Ilpala--

00:03:34.458 --> 00:03:37.208
Hey, you! Hang in there!

00:03:37.208 --> 00:03:39.542
Hey, don't cross over! Don't
fall into the eternal sleep!

00:03:39.542 --> 00:03:42.917
Hey! Hey! Hello?!

00:04:02.208 --> 00:04:03.542
Excel...

00:04:03.542 --> 00:04:06.250
Wake up, Excel.

00:04:07.792 --> 00:04:12.208
Excel, you must not die the
moment the show starts.

00:04:12.208 --> 00:04:15.583
Life is valuable, but more than
that, consider the storyline.

00:04:15.583 --> 00:04:17.208
You are...

00:04:17.208 --> 00:04:17.792
--I am the Will.

00:04:17.792 --> 00:04:19.625
--What'll we do? She's dead.
--I am the Will.

00:04:19.625 --> 00:04:20.083
--What'll we do? She's dead.
--The Great Will of the Macrocosm.

00:04:20.083 --> 00:04:22.417
--Wanna just dump her...?
--The Great Will of the Macrocosm.

00:04:22.417 --> 00:04:26.792
Now, with my great powers,
let us start the story over again.

00:04:33.292 --> 00:04:34.792
That was simple.

00:04:34.792 --> 00:04:36.375
He's talking about you, Will.

00:04:36.375 --> 00:04:38.458
Don't mind me.

00:04:38.458 --> 00:04:41.417
Hail, Ilpalazzo!

00:04:41.417 --> 00:04:43.750
--This world is corrupt! In order to...

00:04:43.750 --> 00:04:46.750
--Yay! Lord Ilpalazzo, hurray!
--This world is corrupt! In order to...

00:04:46.750 --> 00:04:48.958
Il-Il-pala-pala-zzo-zzo-zzo!

00:04:48.958 --> 00:04:50.458
Hey, what's that rope?

00:04:50.458 --> 00:04:53.292
Never mind that now.
More importantly...

00:04:53.292 --> 00:04:54.625
Il-Il-pala-pala.

00:04:54.625 --> 00:04:57.458
--This world is corrupt!
--Lord Ilpalazzo! Love, love!

00:04:57.458 --> 00:05:00.250
In order to prevent
further degeneration,

00:05:00.250 --> 00:05:02.917
the world must be set to rights.

00:05:02.917 --> 00:05:03.750
--However, if...

00:05:03.750 --> 00:05:05.750
--Yahoo! Lord Ilpalazzo!  Dynamite love! Lord Ilpalaz...
--However, if...

00:05:05.750 --> 00:05:08.750
--Yahoo! Lord Ilpalazzo!  Dynamite love! Lord Ilpalaz...

00:05:17.917 --> 00:05:20.875
It is only proper that the
world should be set to rights.

00:05:20.875 --> 00:05:23.042
Oh, so much
to do, so little time.

00:05:23.042 --> 00:05:26.292
However, if we were
to suddenly unite the world,

00:05:26.292 --> 00:05:28.708
the ignorant masses will
surely be unable to keep pace.

00:05:28.708 --> 00:05:31.292
Thus, we will start
with this one country.

00:05:31.292 --> 00:05:33.542
However, in order to avoid
pushing ourselves too hard

00:05:33.542 --> 00:05:36.667
and to be extra prudent,
we will go one step further.

00:05:36.667 --> 00:05:38.292
With this, there will
be nothing to worry about.

00:05:38.292 --> 00:05:41.292
A reasonable plan of conquest
that allows for some leeway.

00:05:41.292 --> 00:05:43.292
The first step towards our ideal.

00:05:43.292 --> 00:05:45.292
In other words, our goal is...

00:05:45.292 --> 00:05:46.625
The conquest of this city!

00:05:46.625 --> 00:05:50.292
Conquest. Oh, what an
arrogant and yet grand idea!

00:05:50.292 --> 00:05:52.625
It's way too splendid,
Lord Ilpalazzo!

00:05:52.625 --> 00:05:56.542
I, Excel, will do anything
for you, Lord Ilpalazzo!

00:05:56.542 --> 00:05:58.125
Through fire! Burn, burn!

00:05:58.125 --> 00:05:59.875
Through water! Pouring!

00:05:59.875 --> 00:06:02.333
If you tell me to strip,
I'll strip straight away.

00:06:02.333 --> 00:06:04.917
If you tell me to
throw up, I'll throw up.

00:06:04.917 --> 00:06:06.333
As an officer of ACROSS

00:06:06.333 --> 00:06:10.042
and as a maiden
who loves Lord Ilpalazzo...

00:06:10.042 --> 00:06:12.625
Oh, please take me, Lord Ilpala...

00:06:16.333 --> 00:06:18.333
You must not rely on that too much.

00:06:18.333 --> 00:06:19.583
I'll be careful!

00:06:19.583 --> 00:06:21.000
Excel, do you know what these are?

00:06:21.000 --> 00:06:22.083
"Excel Saga"
Excel, do you know what these are?

00:06:22.667 --> 00:06:24.375
Manga books, aren't they?

00:06:24.375 --> 00:06:26.833
Correct. It is a published material

00:06:26.833 --> 00:06:29.333
that is circulated in exceedingly
large quantities in this country.

00:06:29.333 --> 00:06:32.583
However, its contents
are base and vulgar!

00:06:32.583 --> 00:06:33.333
How horrible!

00:06:33.333 --> 00:06:37.833
The world that ACROSS
will build has no need of such things!

00:06:37.833 --> 00:06:40.833
Therefore, in anticipation of that day,

00:06:40.833 --> 00:06:42.958
I want you to liquidate
the race of manga artists,

00:06:42.958 --> 00:06:45.458
who create this material.

00:06:45.458 --> 00:06:47.792
Woohoo! Liquidate!

00:06:47.792 --> 00:06:49.625
Yes, my Lord!

00:06:49.625 --> 00:06:52.792
If it is your command, your
humble servant, Excel,

00:06:52.792 --> 00:06:57.125
will blindly liquidate anyone,
be they manga artists or animators!

00:06:57.125 --> 00:07:00.208
Then this man is your first target.

00:07:00.625 --> 00:07:02.333
"Koshi Rikdo (Manga Artist)"

00:07:02.333 --> 00:07:03.375
--I am counting on you to do well.

00:07:03.375 --> 00:07:05.417
--You got it!
--I am counting on you to do well.

00:07:06.208 --> 00:07:12.125
♪ Liquidate! Liquidate!
For Lord Ilpalazzo! ♪

00:07:12.125 --> 00:07:15.667
♪ Genocide without
even asking the reason why! ♪

00:07:15.667 --> 00:07:17.833
One shot of will to kill!

00:07:17.833 --> 00:07:20.833
You're just a manga artist,
discharging evil into society!

00:07:20.833 --> 00:07:23.417
How dare you live
in a place with a roof?!

00:07:23.417 --> 00:07:24.667
"Controversial Statement!"

00:07:28.000 --> 00:07:29.958
"Koshi Rikdo"

00:07:33.250 --> 00:07:35.250
It's show time.

00:07:40.667 --> 00:07:45.833
Lookie here. He's got
weirdo things all lined up.

00:07:47.167 --> 00:07:49.250
Target locked.

00:07:54.208 --> 00:07:57.542
♪ Rikdo, Rikdo, drawing up manga. ♪

00:07:57.542 --> 00:08:01.625
♪ Three days since
I skipped the deadline. ♪

00:08:01.625 --> 00:08:04.125
♪ Still only three days. ♪

00:08:04.667 --> 00:08:05.833
Kill!

00:08:05.833 --> 00:08:07.917
Kill!

00:08:07.917 --> 00:08:08.792
Ki...

00:08:08.792 --> 00:08:11.083
"Good luck"

00:08:15.333 --> 00:08:17.542
Excel, it's wrong, wrong, wrong!

00:08:17.542 --> 00:08:21.625
You must never murder, no matter
what Lord Ilpalazzo commands!

00:08:21.625 --> 00:08:23.583
If the manga artist kicked the bucket,
there are people who--

00:08:24.250 --> 00:08:27.417
What the hell are ya hesitatin'
over at this late date?!

00:08:27.417 --> 00:08:29.250
In Lord Ilpalazzo's world,

00:08:29.250 --> 00:08:31.792
the manga artists are all
gonna get purged anyway!

00:08:31.792 --> 00:08:33.417
Kill 'im! Kill 'im--

00:08:33.417 --> 00:08:34.625
What the hell are ya sayin'?!

00:08:34.625 --> 00:08:36.750
A person's life is
weightier than the Earth!

00:08:36.750 --> 00:08:37.958
Take that!

00:08:37.958 --> 00:08:41.458
Lord Ilpalazzo's command
is weightier than the Earth too!

00:08:41.458 --> 00:08:46.625
No! My heart is wavering
this way and that!

00:08:46.625 --> 00:08:49.292
Oh! Oh! You can do it,
my brain cells!

00:08:49.292 --> 00:08:51.833
Gestapo! Gestapo!

00:08:53.292 --> 00:08:55.333
The bullet of justice that destroys evil!

00:08:55.333 --> 00:08:56.542
How do you like that?!

00:08:56.542 --> 00:08:58.292
What dirty justice.

00:08:58.292 --> 00:08:59.750
It is fine, Etchan!

00:08:59.750 --> 00:09:02.250
Now, go boldly
down the path that is right!

00:09:02.250 --> 00:09:03.125
Boldly!

00:09:03.125 --> 00:09:04.000
"Riku"

00:09:04.292 --> 00:09:07.333
Well, that's all then.

00:09:07.333 --> 00:09:10.083
Ah, well, this is...

00:09:10.083 --> 00:09:14.125
So, you see,
that and that are this and this...

00:09:14.125 --> 00:09:17.458
Hey, what are you doing, Mister?!

00:09:18.333 --> 00:09:21.167
R-R-Robber?!

00:09:21.167 --> 00:09:24.250
No, no, I am not a robber.

00:09:24.250 --> 00:09:26.000
Please no! Please no!

00:09:26.000 --> 00:09:30.000
Please don't worry.
I only came here to liquidate you, so...

00:09:31.875 --> 00:09:35.917
That's right. By the
order of Lord Ilpalazzo,

00:09:35.917 --> 00:09:37.917
I will... I will...

00:09:40.958 --> 00:09:42.792
"Due to the harmful nature of the current scene,"

00:09:42.792 --> 00:09:44.833
"please watch this image screen instead."
I'm sorry! I'm sorry!

00:09:44.833 --> 00:09:45.375
"please watch this image screen instead."
Help...

00:09:45.375 --> 00:09:49.000
Please just think that you've
been bitten by a stray dog and die!

00:09:49.000 --> 00:09:52.542
My, what a tenacious bastard.
Take that!

00:09:59.333 --> 00:10:01.292
"Death"

00:10:01.292 --> 00:10:04.375
I-I've done it, Lord Ilpalazzo!

00:10:04.375 --> 00:10:07.042
I said, I've done it, Lord Ilpalazzo!

00:10:07.042 --> 00:10:11.042
Today's mission completed, with love.

00:10:11.042 --> 00:10:13.083
Huh? "With"?

00:10:16.875 --> 00:10:20.042
I wonder what kinda
manga he was drawing?

00:10:20.750 --> 00:10:22.750
T-This is...

00:10:26.542 --> 00:10:29.917
Excel, Excel...

00:10:29.917 --> 00:10:32.625
You must not kill the original author.

00:10:32.625 --> 00:10:35.542
I'm so sorry. I suppose it was wrong.

00:10:35.542 --> 00:10:39.750
Now, I will restore the story
to normality with my great powers.

00:10:39.750 --> 00:10:41.458
Here we go!

00:10:43.458 --> 00:10:45.250
"We are very sorry for the inconvenience
- Soko Mate Construction"

00:10:48.917 --> 00:10:50.583
What? Me?

00:10:52.250 --> 00:10:54.542
Okay! Go!

00:10:54.542 --> 00:10:59.083
You, taxi, stop! Stop!
Go! Go! And stop, stop!

00:10:59.083 --> 00:11:03.083
Go and stop! Oh yeah, baby!

00:11:05.042 --> 00:11:07.583
I wonder if I'll last
for eight hours like this?

00:11:07.583 --> 00:11:09.625
Hey, part-timer girl!

00:11:09.625 --> 00:11:11.167
Yo, Foreman!

00:11:11.167 --> 00:11:13.167
There's ten tons coming.

00:11:13.375 --> 00:11:25.333
"Excel Saga"
"Quack Experimental Anime"

00:11:27.625 --> 00:11:31.125
Hey, girl, you okay?

00:11:32.125 --> 00:11:35.125
Yeah! This is nothing!

00:11:35.125 --> 00:11:36.667
I'm amazed you survived that.

00:11:36.667 --> 00:11:39.667
Well, of course!
If I carelessly died there,

00:11:39.667 --> 00:11:44.833
we'd have to reset the
story that's already come so far.

00:11:44.833 --> 00:11:47.000
Now, back to work! Back to work!

00:11:47.000 --> 00:11:50.000
You certainly are
a hard worker. Good, good.

00:11:51.208 --> 00:11:56.000
Even this building will eventually
belong to Lord Ilpalazzo.

00:11:56.000 --> 00:12:01.167
The ignorant masses are slaving away,
working hard to build it.

00:12:01.167 --> 00:12:04.125
So, it certainly gives me
incentive to work too.

00:12:04.125 --> 00:12:05.792
Ah, well, well.

00:12:07.042 --> 00:12:09.000
Now, all you people
of the ignorant masses,

00:12:09.000 --> 00:12:10.708
for the sake of the coming purge,

00:12:10.708 --> 00:12:13.625
sweat your blood out!
Don't wipe your tears! Let's work!

00:12:13.625 --> 00:12:16.667
Don't stop! Move and stop
and move and stop!

00:12:16.667 --> 00:12:19.792
Lord Ilpalazzo, Excel is working hard!

00:12:21.375 --> 00:12:22.625
"We'll take the grand prize of this
year's records! - Misty Blue"

00:12:23.917 --> 00:12:25.417
Visual type...

00:12:26.750 --> 00:12:28.542
All right, all right, drive, drive!

00:12:28.542 --> 00:12:31.875
Up and down!
Round and round! Good work!

00:12:31.875 --> 00:12:34.917
Hey, you suspicious
foreign car, don't park there!

00:12:34.917 --> 00:12:37.708
And you compact car too!
Take it easy on the cutting in!

00:12:37.708 --> 00:12:41.208
And while I'm at it, you police car!
Don't speed without lights!

00:12:41.208 --> 00:12:43.750
It's really turned into a traffic jam.

00:12:43.750 --> 00:12:46.708
I wonder why there are so many cars?

00:12:47.542 --> 00:12:51.542
After unification, it would be
good to cut down on drivers too.

00:12:51.542 --> 00:12:52.875
Oh?

00:13:03.125 --> 00:13:04.583
Pedro!

00:13:04.583 --> 00:13:06.250
Miss Excel!

00:13:10.083 --> 00:13:13.875
Guarandoo!

00:13:13.875 --> 00:13:15.583
Hey, you don't seem very cheerful, Pedro.

00:13:15.583 --> 00:13:17.333
You think so?

00:13:17.333 --> 00:13:19.042
You got something on your mind?

00:13:19.042 --> 00:13:22.417
Try telling the true
and warm Miss Excel.

00:13:26.750 --> 00:13:28.458
This is?

00:13:28.458 --> 00:13:32.083
Sandora, my son.

00:13:32.083 --> 00:13:35.625
Well, please take a
look at the reference footage.

00:13:38.792 --> 00:13:40.083
Papa!

00:13:40.083 --> 00:13:41.625
Sandora!

00:13:42.792 --> 00:13:45.125
Welcome home, Dear.

00:13:45.125 --> 00:13:48.292
Sandora's always so
happy when you come home.

00:13:48.292 --> 00:13:53.417
Actually, Mama's happy too.
Papa, you too, right?

00:13:53.417 --> 00:13:55.417
Why, you little!

00:13:56.833 --> 00:13:58.833
What, you're homesick?

00:13:58.833 --> 00:14:01.167
Yes, I am.

00:14:01.167 --> 00:14:03.708
It's been two years
since I came to Japan.

00:14:03.708 --> 00:14:08.500
When I think of how my dear son
and sexy wife might be doing...

00:14:09.333 --> 00:14:11.833
Pedro, you idiot!

00:14:16.625 --> 00:14:17.958
--Miss Excel...

00:14:17.958 --> 00:14:19.917
--One more, you idiot!
--Miss Excel...

00:14:19.917 --> 00:14:22.625
Isn't that a little harsh?

00:14:22.625 --> 00:14:24.833
What are you going
to do by being so weak?!

00:14:24.833 --> 00:14:27.833
If your son is really dear to
you and your wife is really sexy,

00:14:27.833 --> 00:14:30.458
then you should work
and sweat for the two of them!

00:14:30.458 --> 00:14:31.625
That's what is called true love!

00:14:31.625 --> 00:14:33.500
Pedro is shocked!

00:14:33.500 --> 00:14:36.625
True love...

00:14:36.625 --> 00:14:41.292
That's right. Let's keep our
little complaints to ourselves.

00:14:41.292 --> 00:14:44.458
And right now, let's work!

00:14:44.458 --> 00:14:46.667
That is the path
that we part-timers walk!

00:14:46.667 --> 00:14:51.417
Miss Excel, my tears
are flowing like waterfalls!

00:14:51.417 --> 00:14:52.833
Let's go, Pedro!

00:14:52.833 --> 00:14:55.458
Yes, Miss Excel!

00:14:55.458 --> 00:14:56.333
--Billy Jean!

00:14:56.333 --> 00:14:58.333
--John Travo...
--Billy Jean!

00:15:05.208 --> 00:15:09.208
Wear a helmet and there's
nothing to worry about!

00:15:09.208 --> 00:15:11.875
Hey, Pedro! Help me out over here!

00:15:11.875 --> 00:15:13.375
With pleasure!

00:15:13.375 --> 00:15:15.833
Thank you, Miss Excel.

00:15:15.833 --> 00:15:19.083
Thanks to you, I can work again.

00:15:19.083 --> 00:15:23.167
I was able to regain the joy of labor.

00:15:23.167 --> 00:15:26.708
My tears are once
again flowing like waterfalls!

00:15:26.708 --> 00:15:29.875
Pedro, you really
are such a hard worker.

00:15:29.875 --> 00:15:32.250
I could do this before breakfast!

00:15:32.250 --> 00:15:35.833
Of course, I already had lunch.

00:15:37.208 --> 00:15:41.542
Damn, you've even picked
up on the stupid Japanese jokes.

00:15:41.542 --> 00:15:45.333
All right, I think I'll add on
a little to your daily wage today.

00:15:45.333 --> 00:15:46.750
Really?!

00:15:47.542 --> 00:15:48.708
Don't tell that Gomez, all right?

00:15:48.708 --> 00:15:50.292
"That Gomez"

00:15:50.583 --> 00:15:53.958
Thank you, Foreman. Thank you.

00:15:54.750 --> 00:15:56.417
Good, good.

00:15:56.417 --> 00:15:59.625
All right! I'm gonna work hard too!

00:16:04.375 --> 00:16:06.250
The hunger has gone to my legs.

00:16:06.250 --> 00:16:08.250
No, bear it! Bear it!

00:16:08.250 --> 00:16:09.750
Once I get paid for today's work,

00:16:09.750 --> 00:16:13.250
I can have a meal legally
for the first time in four days.

00:16:13.917 --> 00:16:16.125
This is the true test of my loyalty!

00:16:16.125 --> 00:16:17.875
For Lord Ilpalazzo!

00:16:17.875 --> 00:16:20.917
Consider the results of
our ideal and the great glory!

00:16:20.917 --> 00:16:22.250
What's an empty stomach or two?!

00:16:22.250 --> 00:16:24.583
The world will be ours
to do with as we please!

00:16:24.583 --> 00:16:25.458
--Even the old guy!

00:16:25.458 --> 00:16:26.042
--Yes?
--Even the old guy!

00:16:26.042 --> 00:16:26.917
--Even the office lady!

00:16:26.917 --> 00:16:27.958
--Yes?
--Even the office lady!

00:16:27.958 --> 00:16:28.750
--Even Pedro!

00:16:28.750 --> 00:16:29.792
--Yes?
--Even Pedro!

00:16:29.792 --> 00:16:31.792
And even the mutt!

00:16:35.292 --> 00:16:38.625
There is one Earth!
If it splits, there'll be two!

00:16:38.625 --> 00:16:42.500
Mankind all in servitude
to us, and beautiful!

00:16:43.292 --> 00:16:45.083
So can I keep on going?

00:16:45.083 --> 00:16:46.583
Hail!

00:16:47.583 --> 00:16:48.917
Il

00:16:49.792 --> 00:16:51.125
pala

00:16:51.958 --> 00:16:53.958
zzo!

00:17:04.083 --> 00:17:04.250
Oh?

00:17:04.250 --> 00:17:05.583
"Safety - Security"

00:17:08.875 --> 00:17:11.375
Run, everyone!

00:17:14.750 --> 00:17:16.500
S-Sandora!

00:17:27.250 --> 00:17:29.917
What's he doing?! Pedro!

00:17:31.750 --> 00:17:35.292
It's hot! It's hot!

00:17:35.292 --> 00:17:39.458
You idiot! Pedro, you big idiot!

00:17:39.458 --> 00:17:42.000
W-W-What should I do?

00:17:42.000 --> 00:17:44.833
What are you hesitating for?!
You must go save him!

00:17:44.833 --> 00:17:48.667
But what if something
were to happen to me too?

00:17:48.667 --> 00:17:51.375
Who would serve Lord Ilpalazzo?

00:17:51.375 --> 00:17:53.917
There are plenty of people
who could replace you!

00:17:54.750 --> 00:17:58.000
A human life is almost as
heavy as the Earth!

00:17:58.000 --> 00:18:01.250
Come! Work up your
courage and let's go help...

00:18:01.250 --> 00:18:02.542
Good Excel!

00:18:02.542 --> 00:18:06.542
You are under arrest
for the murder of Bad Excel.

00:18:06.542 --> 00:18:08.833
Well, you heard her.
Take care of the rest for me.

00:18:08.833 --> 00:18:09.875
--What am I supposed to do?

00:18:09.875 --> 00:18:10.583
--Put out the fire, quick!
--What am I supposed to do?

00:18:10.583 --> 00:18:11.208
--Put out the fire, quick!
--This is... This is...

00:18:11.208 --> 00:18:12.583
--My arm is burning!
--This is... This is... My arm!

00:18:12.583 --> 00:18:12.875
--My arm! My arm is burning!

00:18:12.875 --> 00:18:13.750
--Pedro!
--My arm! My arm is burning!

00:18:13.750 --> 00:18:15.625
This was an accident
beyond human control!

00:18:15.625 --> 00:18:17.208
"Manslaughter due to
Professional Negligence"

00:18:22.542 --> 00:18:23.500
Pedro!

00:18:23.500 --> 00:18:25.375
It's no good!
He's probably already...

00:18:25.375 --> 00:18:28.792
I'm sorry. I'm sorry!

00:18:28.792 --> 00:18:33.125
Mr. Foreman, everyone
at the site, and Pedro...

00:18:33.125 --> 00:18:35.083
I'm really sorry!

00:18:35.083 --> 00:18:38.375
But I can't allow myself
to get caught right now.

00:18:38.375 --> 00:18:40.625
Necessity knows no law.

00:18:40.625 --> 00:18:42.125
Necessity...

00:18:44.625 --> 00:18:48.750
Oh, no. My hunger's
gone to my legs after all.

00:18:52.583 --> 00:18:53.917
Dog...

00:18:53.917 --> 00:18:54.917
"Dog"

00:18:54.917 --> 00:18:55.917
"Dog -> Creature"

00:18:55.917 --> 00:18:56.583
"Dog -> Creature -> Food"

00:19:00.083 --> 00:19:02.750
Stop right there!

00:19:02.750 --> 00:19:04.750
Meat! Meat!

00:19:04.750 --> 00:19:07.375
Meat! Stop, meat!

00:19:18.417 --> 00:19:22.167
Mr. Pedro? Mr. Pedro?

00:19:23.833 --> 00:19:25.958
Poor Mr. Pedro.

00:19:25.958 --> 00:19:29.792
I will send you back to your
dear son and your sexy wife.

00:19:29.792 --> 00:19:33.125
Oh, it's time. I have to go. <i>Ciao!</i>

00:19:34.125 --> 00:19:36.625
No!

00:19:49.792 --> 00:19:51.542
"The electronic guitar set that
anyone can play is finally on sale!"

00:19:52.000 --> 00:19:52.917
--Did you find him?!

00:19:52.917 --> 00:19:55.833
--No. Where the hell did he go, damn it?!
--Did you find him?!

00:19:56.667 --> 00:20:00.875
Why? Why is her progress
after childbirth so bad?!

00:20:00.875 --> 00:20:02.208
There's the afro guy!

00:20:02.208 --> 00:20:04.500
Stop right there, you bastard!

00:20:04.500 --> 00:20:06.417
Sorry, Kumiko!

00:20:06.417 --> 00:20:09.250
Stop right there!

00:20:09.250 --> 00:20:11.250
I'm so hungry.

00:20:13.458 --> 00:20:17.000
I'll have to find another
part-time job again.

00:20:17.000 --> 00:20:19.458
And for that,
I'd better get my strength up.

00:20:19.458 --> 00:20:21.458
Get a nutritious meal.

00:20:24.292 --> 00:20:26.167
Tonight, right now,

00:20:26.167 --> 00:20:29.833
a moment of luxury as I have this
meal that I spent all my money on.

00:20:29.833 --> 00:20:34.000
Regardless of my desperate fight,
I'm in the red again this month.

00:20:34.000 --> 00:20:38.333
And so, I will have this stew,
which may be my final meal...

00:20:38.333 --> 00:20:39.667
I'll have some too!

00:20:39.667 --> 00:20:41.958
Iwata! Bastard,
where'd you come from?!

00:20:41.958 --> 00:20:44.833
"Me too!"
Hey! Sumiyoshi, not you too!

00:20:44.833 --> 00:20:45.458
--Let me have some stew!

00:20:45.458 --> 00:20:49.042
I guess the neighbors are
having stew tonight. Lucky them.

00:20:49.042 --> 00:20:50.250
Well, tonight, I've got...

00:20:50.250 --> 00:20:52.417
--Don't touch!
--You can't have that meat!

00:20:52.417 --> 00:20:53.208
--Yummy!

00:20:53.208 --> 00:20:54.542
--Stop it!
--Yummy!

00:20:57.542 --> 00:21:00.542
Sandora, it's dinnertime!

00:21:00.542 --> 00:21:04.042
I told you not to keep on
playing soccer by yourself.

00:21:04.042 --> 00:21:07.625
But Papa's taking so long to come home.

00:21:07.625 --> 00:21:11.917
Papa is at work. Don't be so unreasonable.

00:21:11.917 --> 00:21:14.208
Okay. As long as you're here,

00:21:14.208 --> 00:21:17.542
I can wait forever for
Papa to come home.

00:21:17.542 --> 00:21:19.542
Come on, the soup is going to get cold.

00:21:19.542 --> 00:21:21.250
Forget about Dad.

00:21:21.250 --> 00:21:24.583
No!

00:21:26.042 --> 00:21:28.292
An accurate count of
deaths in this terrible disaster

00:21:28.292 --> 00:21:30.917
has still not been determined.

00:21:30.917 --> 00:21:32.500
--We will be pursuing
that along with the cause...

00:21:32.500 --> 00:21:35.250
The world is still corrupt as always.

00:21:35.250 --> 00:21:37.958
Hail, Ilpalazzo!

00:21:37.958 --> 00:21:41.500
Ah, Excel, wastefully cheerful as usual.

00:21:41.500 --> 00:21:44.417
Yes! What are your
orders for today?

00:21:44.417 --> 00:21:45.917
Hmm, well...

00:21:53.250 --> 00:22:00.417
♪ La la la, manga artists are
the scum of society, failures of life. ♪

00:22:00.417 --> 00:22:02.792
♪ Lu lu lu, good for nothings. ♪

00:22:02.792 --> 00:22:06.292
♪ The world won't miss us,
even if we die. ♪

00:22:06.292 --> 00:22:09.417
For Lord Ilpalazzo...
For Lord Ilpalazzo...

00:22:09.417 --> 00:22:11.458
For Lord Ilpalazzo!

00:22:17.208 --> 00:22:19.458
And a one, two...

00:22:20.667 --> 00:22:24.292
"Episode 1: Koshi Rikdo Assassination Plot"

00:22:24.292 --> 00:22:27.667
"Episode 1: Koshi Rikdo Assassination Plot"
"Today's Experiment..."

00:22:27.667 --> 00:22:29.167
"Episode 1: Koshi Rikdo Assassination Plot"
"Today Experiment... Failed"

00:22:51.042 --> 00:22:59.500
<i>I knew, ever since that day</i>

00:22:59.500 --> 00:23:06.875
<i>The reason you had approached me</i>

00:23:06.875 --> 00:23:15.000
<i>Tender and soft</i>

00:23:15.000 --> 00:23:23.750
<i>That my body is to your taste</i>

00:23:24.708 --> 00:23:32.500
<i>To your hunger-stricken eyes</i>

00:23:32.500 --> 00:23:40.375
<i>How does my body seem</i>

00:23:40.375 --> 00:23:48.250
<i>If you are to eat me, do it in one blow</i>

00:23:48.250 --> 00:23:57.042
<i>So that the meat does not get hard</i>

00:24:00.500 --> 00:24:01.708
Yo, Excel here!

00:24:01.708 --> 00:24:03.375
You there, totally
flabbergasted by episode one.

00:24:03.375 --> 00:24:04.625
Big news for the fans of the original,

00:24:04.625 --> 00:24:06.125
who are thinking of not watching any more.

00:24:06.125 --> 00:24:07.583
She's going to be showing up,
that woman, starting next episode.

00:24:07.583 --> 00:24:08.750
The hint is "Ha". And also blood.

00:24:08.750 --> 00:24:10.083
In any case,
we may be a pretty girl anime

00:24:10.083 --> 00:24:11.417
where flowers bloom
all over and birds fly,

00:24:11.417 --> 00:24:14.875
but flowers bloom on heads
here and our birds are harpies.

00:24:14.875 --> 00:24:17.250
Quack Experimental Anime,
Excel Saga of the end of the century!

00:24:17.250 --> 00:24:19.583
The next episode might already
have spawned a letter of apology.

00:24:19.583 --> 00:24:20.708
"The Woman From Mars"

00:24:20.708 --> 00:24:22.417
In English, that would be
"Woman came from Mars."

00:24:22.417 --> 00:24:24.458
Oh! So glad I attended
the local English school!

00:24:24.458 --> 00:24:28.594
Speak English and make
friends with ten billion people,
